  "description": {
   "en": "Momo, 26 years old. Her dream, halfway. She works as an actress in a small theater company while working as an office temp three days a week. She keeps her acting a secret from her colleagues at work, because it's the most important thing to her and she's afraid of losing it.\n\nAmidst her beautiful friends, an energetic theater company leader and a steadfast star actress, Momo feels anxious and impatient about living her empty days. Is it okay for her to go on like this...?"
  },
